  "help": {
    "documentTitle": "幫助 - BizTrack",
    "title": "BizTrack 快速指南",
    "Help - BizTrack": "幫助 - BizTrack",
    "Using BizTrack: A Quick Guide": "BizTrack 快速指南",
    "What is BizTrack?": "甚麼是 BizTrack？",
    "BizTrack is your go-to business management tool designed with small business owners in mind. It's an all-in-one platform that helps you effortlessly manage your products, track orders, and stay on top of your finances. Let me walk you through the basics:": "BizTrack 是為小型企業主設計的業務管理工具。它是一個一站式平台，協助你管理產品、追蹤訂單，並掌握財務狀況。以下是基本用法：",
    "Navigating the Dashboard": "瀏覽儀表板",
    "The Dashboard is your central hub, giving you a snapshot of your business's overall performance. Here, you'll find key metrics like total expenses, revenues, profits and the number of orders. It's your command center for a quick overview.": "儀表板是你的核心視圖，會顯示業務整體表現，包括總支出、收入、利潤和訂單數量等關鍵指標，方便你快速掌握狀況。",
    "Expenses Page": "支出頁面",
    "Record Your Expenses:": "記錄支出：",
    "Head to the Expenses page to add your business expenses. Fill in the date, choose a category, enter the amount, and jot down any notes. It's that simple.": "前往支出頁面新增業務支出，填寫日期、選擇分類、輸入金額並加入備註即可。",
    "Edit or Delete Expenses:": "編輯或刪除支出：",
    "Edit or Delete Expenses: Made a mistake? No worries! You can easily edit or delete expense records right from the Expenses page.": "填錯了也不用擔心，你可以直接在支出頁面編輯或刪除支出記錄。",
    "Orders Page": "訂單頁面",
    "Track Your Orders:": "追蹤訂單：",
    "On the Orders page, you can keep tabs on all your orders. Each entry details the product, quantity, and order status.": "在訂單頁面，你可以查看所有訂單。每筆記錄都包含產品、數量和訂單狀態。",
    "Effortless Editing:": "輕鬆編輯：",
    "effortlessEditingBody": "需要更新訂單狀態時，點擊「編輯」按鈕即可修改。",
    "Need to update an order status? Click the \"Edit\" button and make your changes. It's hassle-free.": "需要更新訂單狀態時，點擊「編輯」按鈕即可修改。",
    "Adding a New Expense, Order or Product": "新增支出、訂單或產品",
    "addStepOpen": "點擊「新增支出」，或在訂單和產品頁面點擊相應的新增按鈕。",
    "Click on \"Add Expense\" or the equivalent button on the order or product page.": "點擊「新增支出」，或在訂單和產品頁面點擊相應的新增按鈕。",
    "Fill in the product details or order details or transaction date, category, amount, and any notes.": "填寫產品資料、訂單資料，或交易日期、分類、金額和備註。",
    "addStepDone": "提交後，訂單、產品或交易會顯示在相應頁面和儀表板上。",
    "Hit \"Done,\" and you're all set. Your order, product or transaction will now appear in the respective page and on the Dashboard.": "提交後，訂單、產品或交易會顯示在相應頁面和儀表板上。",
    "Sorting and Searching Entries/Tables": "排序和搜尋記錄",
    "Click on any column heading (headers) to sort the entries in the table by that column in either ascending order or alphabetical order.": "點擊表格欄位標題，可以按該欄位以升序或字母順序排序。",
    "You can also search for a particular product, order or expense by entrering the value in the search box at the top of the respective page.": "你也可以在相應頁面頂部的搜尋框輸入內容，搜尋特定產品、訂單或支出。",
    "Export to CSV": "匯出 CSV",
    "exportBackupBody": "想備份或在其他工具分析資料時，只需點擊「匯出 CSV」即可下載包含業務資料的 CSV 檔案。",
    "Want to keep a backup or analyze your data elsewhere? Simply click on \"Export to CSV\" to download a CSV file with all your business data.": "想備份或在其他工具分析資料時，只需點擊「匯出 CSV」即可下載包含業務資料的 CSV 檔案。",
    "BizTrack is designed to be intuitive, user-friendly, and adaptable to your business needs. Explore the different pages, try out the features, and let BizTrack simplify your small business management.": "BizTrack 的設計重點是直觀、易用並適配你的業務需要。你可以探索不同頁面和功能，讓 BizTrack 簡化小型企業管理。",
    "Have questions, feedback, or just want to connect? Feel free to reach out!": "有問題、回饋，或想聯絡我？歡迎隨時聯繫。"
  },
  "about": {
    "documentTitle": "關於 - BizTrack",
    "title": "我的編程旅程",
    "introHeading": "你好，我是 Sumayyah！",
    "About - Biztrack": "關於 - BizTrack",
    "My Coding Journey": "我的編程旅程",
    "Welcome to my little corner of the internet, where I'm rolling up my sleeves and diving into the coding world. I’m not your typical tech guru – I’m just a small business owner navigating the hustle and bustle of entrepreneurship. Oh, and did I mention I’m also part of the": "歡迎來到我的網上角落。在這裡，我正一步步投入編程世界。我不是典型的科技專家，只是一位正在經營小生意、努力面對創業日常的人。對了，我也是",
    "program? Yeah, it's been quite the journey, and I owe a huge shoutout to my coding coach, Sam.": "課程的一員。這段旅程收穫很多，也非常感謝我的編程導師 Sam。",
    "Let me spill the tea on BizTrack, my brainchild. So, picture this: I'm running a small business, trying to keep tabs on products, orders, and the never-ending finances - It’s a lot. That's when the light bulb moment happened, and BizTrack was born. It's not just a project; it's my answer to the chaos that comes with managing a business.": "說說 BizTrack 這個想法吧。經營小生意時，我需要同時管理產品、訂單和各種財務資料，事情很快就會變得繁雜。因此我產生了建立 BizTrack 的想法。它不只是一個項目，而是我對業務管理混亂狀態的一個實際回應。",
    "BizTrack is my attempt at making life a bit more straightforward for small business owners like me. You know, the ones who are constantly multitasking and could use a break. It's a manifestation of my passion for leveraging technology to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of business operations. It's not polished; it's not perfect, it's just a real solution for real-world challenges.": "BizTrack 是我嘗試為小型企業主簡化日常工作的一步。它來自我對技術的興趣，也希望透過技術提升業務運作效率。它不完美，但它是面向真實問題的實用解決方案。",
    "I'm a student at GetCoding NL, a software development program that's turning me from someone who googles how websites work into someone who actually understands and builds them. And guess what? BizTrack is my first module project, allowing me to practically apply the skills and knowledge gained in the program. Learning by doing, they say, and that’s exactly what I'm doing.": "我是 GetCoding NL 的學生。這個軟件開發課程正在把我從只會搜尋「網站如何運作」的人，變成真正理解並能建構網站的人。BizTrack 是我的第一個模組項目，讓我能把課程學到的知識用到實際作品中。",
    "But none of this would be possible without the guidance of my amazing coach,": "如果沒有我出色導師的指導，這些都不會成真：",
    "Sam has been the compass in my coding journey. Patient, encouraging, and always ready with a helpful tip – he has made navigating the coding seas a whole lot less daunting.": "Sam 一直是我編程旅程中的重要指引。他耐心、鼓勵我，並總能提供實用建議，讓學習過程變得不那麼令人畏懼。",
    "So, why spill all this in an about me section? Well, I’m not just sharing my story; I’m inviting you to join me on my journey. Whether you're into the chaos of small business life, curious about coding escapades, or just want to see where the two collide – you're welcome here.": "為甚麼要在關於頁分享這些？因為我不只是分享故事，也希望邀請你一起見證這段旅程。無論你關注小生意的日常、對編程好奇，或想看看兩者如何結合，都歡迎你來到這裡。",
    "Here's to coding, chaos, everything in between and heartfelt thanks to Sam!": "敬編程、敬忙碌日常，也真心感謝 Sam！"
  },
  "privacy": {
    "documentTitle": "私隱政策 - BizTrack",
    "title": "私隱政策",
    "heading": "我們重視你的私隱",
    "Privacy Policy - BizTrack": "私隱政策 - BizTrack",
    "BizTrack is a client-side small-business dashboard. Products, orders, expenses, language preference, and cookie consent are stored in this browser through localStorage.": "BizTrack 是一個客戶端小型業務儀表板。產品、訂單、支出、語言偏好和 Cookie 同意狀態都會透過 localStorage 儲存在此瀏覽器。",
    "No account system, analytics tracker, advertising cookie, or server-side personal-data collection is used by this version of the application.": "此版本沒有帳戶系統、分析追蹤器、廣告 Cookie 或伺服器端個人資料收集。",
    "You can remove stored records at any time by clearing this site's browser data. Exported CSV files are created locally and are controlled by the user after download.": "你可以隨時清除此網站的瀏覽器資料來移除已儲存記錄。匯出的 CSV 檔案在本機產生，下載後由使用者自行管理。"
  },
